SUMMARY:WEEKLY COMMUNITY NIGHT
DESCRIPTION:This is our laid-back weekly hangout where you can meet new peo
 ple‚ talk‚ explore worlds‚ play games‚ or just vibe. We welcome pre
 tty much everyone furries‚ LGBTQ+‚ neurodivergent folks‚ systems‚ a
 nd people from all backgrounds‚ races‚ and walks of life. We don't care
  who you are. Just don't be a predator or a complete WEIRDO. Every weekend
 ‚ the community gets to decide what we doǃ It could be VRChat worlds‚ 
 games‚ movie nights‚ random activities‚ or whatever else people want 
 to get into. HOW DOES IT WORK? If you're in our Discord‚ there will be a 
 poll for each community night. Whatever the community votes for is what we'
 ll plan for that weekend. WE WANT TO HEAR YOUǃ Your votes help shape what 
 we do and what kind of events we host. We're also adults here‚ so we're n
 ot going to judge anyone for having a drink or getting high on their own ti
 me. Just be responsible and don't make it everyone else's problem. MAKE SUR
 E THEY READ WHAT THIS GROUP ISǃǃǃ
