SUMMARY:Mindful Communication
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Communication is purposefully paying attention to our i
 nteractions with others without judgment. Listening with our full attention
 ‚ presence‚ and empathy. Speaking with loving-kindness and assertivenes
 s. Join us for an interactive‚ topic-based event where we explore how to 
 bring more presence‚ clarity‚ and compassion into the ways we communica
 te. Each event features a specific communication topic such as ~ Boundaries
  ~ Active listening ~ Communication styles ~ Non-violent communication We w
 ill introduce these topics through an activity‚ short video‚ reading‚
  or slides‚ followed by a guided group discussion. This is a space for le
 arning‚ reflection‚ and connection through shared conversation. We aim 
 to build skills and strategies we can use in our relationships and daily co
 mmunication.
